<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel is positioning forces to resume an offensive in southern Lebanon, contingent on renewed fighting with Iran, while Hezbollah continues artillery fire on Israeli positions and has begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. The Israeli army has built a new road in the Shebaa Valley buffer zone, expanding its presence near the border. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon by the fighting. 4,335 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQdnc1SHdyNVlYREJSd19VN1BsSzFtTjZzOUxOdWxnT1E3enlpQ014b2FaZDJkVXM1b0xTdy1MQ015M2FZMHRncjFYUWh2UVRYYU9jTzdOTGRNQzNPcjhDQWZ6QlNobk9KZ0xIUjhjWmVkTm5IMGFBcGw5dTJ4LXpiVTdPNWtMaVhOUTczT1ppMmE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Menafn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFBZTThBWTRGWXd6cUNTRVYxb2tsRzR4TlV1aXlXVzNJRWhYaFNCVWN6Z0cxdXZkQ0syOVlDV3ZTekR0ekZiYXZQOEplSlc2WXlf?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPT0lUXzBoM2RNaGd4Z0l3Y2IyeXg4ZFpQM0Rta3ZxS3piTURFMlZnQjZMUWxLbDdObVRlX1ZzX0VHUzNPZnF1U1BoZWdTRlJKWDYzN3dBNkN1ZWRzOHdJVU5xZ1RZc0lKdjNTeE00Rmxnd2doYWk2RVFZNGxKU1h6YmtGWU8wTUsyWmE4LWZfUHVGZkR0U25UN2dfMkY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Şafak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Honest Reporting Canada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;L'Orient Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOeEgtYS1iY3M3VG1kV1V6SmJuZG4yZ1R1cmFBckNyYlNvM2ZOX25GU0JnRVlrQVA5SldMVXB6dGVCSS1FeE1FbERhOFQ2Y0lqV29qeEdUNUJKUWJhNnJKQ3hPeXdQNXVSVDY0aDBhX3B4MG1uRndNa0g1Wnl5Rm5